Package: healthkicks-edge-agent
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: HealthKicks <maintainers@healthkicks.local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-joblib, python3-paho-mqtt, python3-pydantic (>= 2.0), python3-serial, python3-sklearn, adduser
Description: HealthKicks local Raspberry Pi edge agent
 Local edge agent for Arduino IMU and haptic actuator communication.
 Performs local anomaly detection and communicates with a Mosquitto MQTT broker.
